{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792092240, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T19:24:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T19:25:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792092300, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T19:24:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18904, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "民權西路和中山北交叉\n上下班時間因為行人要過馬路\n機車道被公車上下車和轉彎車一直擋住\n紅綠燈都過不了", "display_name": "中山代表 佳宜", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T19:24:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33121, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "天母中山北路七段的商家都倒光了沒有往日榮景", "display_name": "士林代表 No.33,121", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T19:24:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9015, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "路上（尤其是騎樓）好多人抽菸，走路上下班需要時不時憋氣快跑，真的好疲憊，但又想好好保護自己的健康。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.9,015", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T19:24:38+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33228, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "走讀是好的觀光模式", "display_name": "中山代表 No.33,228", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T19:24:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4255, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的馬路巷弄交通信號太多，再來是門牌號碼亂七八糟，還有近來仁愛路大安路的庇護島？莫名奇妙擾民塞車", "display_name": "大安代表 No.4,255", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 33121, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.33,121", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 9015, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.9,015", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": tr